  "body": "Fixes #312. Integrate Sam\u2019s3f3abd29cced846dead9d821cfa50ad822c62fc7 on current next, with a precise helper contract. One plain cohort, each keyed/derive hasher alone; one existing kernel body, no recursion/remainder copies/key-value dispatch. Independent201release/22docs/all configurations and key-equality red/restored control pass, including600-hasher cases. Sam\u2019s source-specific x86 shared-key complete-cycle costs reach9.5%Ice/15.5%EPYC; plain/mixed Level, distinct-key gains. Correctness warrants that documented cost; no blanket no-regression claim. Full numbers/source report are in the review commit. Native/CI/mutations/ARM cost assessment pending; native timing waits for mains power. Main backport being prepared separately; no release.\n\n\u2014 John Servil",
